    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DARK FRONT \u2013 THE DARKEST FRONTS OF WAR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Front combines the historical authenticity of World War II with striking visuals in a story-focused FPS experience. The game throws you right into the heart of the battlefield: parachute into the Western Front, advance with British troops through the deserts of North Africa, and endure the freezing lands of the Eastern Front with the Soviets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the cutting-edge graphics capabilities of Unreal Engine 5, feel every face of war \u2014 from ruined cities to snow-covered steppes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Story Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Fight across various fronts with soldiers from different nations. Experience missions inspired by real historical events, making you feel like you're inside history itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Modes (Coop):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress in teams of four in a 1940s horror atmosphere. Survival and exploration-focused missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <strong>Multiplayer Mode (5v5):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Intense skirmishes with small teams. Classic modes include Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Authenticity and Atmosphere:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Historically accurate fronts and maps inspired by real locations. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DARK FRONT \u2013 THE DARKEST FRONTS OF WAR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Front combines the historical authenticity of World War II with striking visuals in a story-focused FPS experience. The game throws you right into the heart of the battlefield: parachute into the Western Front, advance with British troops through the deserts of North Africa, and endure the freezing lands of the Eastern Front with the Soviets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the cutting-edge graphics capabilities of Unreal Engine 5, feel every face of war \u2014 from ruined cities to snow-covered steppes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Story Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Fight across various fronts with soldiers from different nations. Experience missions inspired by real historical events, making you feel like you're inside history itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Modes (Coop):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress in teams of four in a 1940s horror atmosphere. Survival and exploration-focused missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <strong>Multiplayer Mode (5v5):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Intense skirmishes with small teams. Classic modes include Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Authenticity and Atmosphere:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Historically accurate fronts and maps inspired by real locations. </p>",
